    "Home >",
    "Host",
    "And it's a game best served for all. Tennis experience or not, everyone you know can step in the lines and have the time of their lives.",
    "You can organize a league at the local brewery, build team morale at the office, and add a program to the tennis facility. No limits. Just Red Ball Tennis.",
